        },
        {
          "text": "Ewe Yerusalemu, nshize abashibamyi hejuru ku nzitiro zawe z’amabuye; nta ho bazocereza ku murango no mw ijoro; yemwe abibutsa Uhoraho ntimukaruhuke, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.6",
