        },
        {
          "text": "Ni murenge, ni murenge amarembo; mutunganirize abantu inzira; muharure, muharure inzira y’iroro, muyikūremw’ amabuye; mushingire amoko ibendera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.10",
